    "description": "Vacant and Ready. We are accepting back up offers.  Fully remodeled in 2022.  2 Unit Building a half a block to Lake St. Why buy a house when you can buy and live in a 2 unit building and use as a family compound. This 2 unit luxury building allows many rooms and spaces for in-laws, nannies, home offices and guest rooms. Great family neighborhood. Great schools in the Richmond Neighborhood. Fantastic neighborhood for walking and biking. 12 minute drive to Ocean Beach. Sea Cliff and Presidio Golf Course is 8 minutes via driving. This is a high income producing property. 174 is a 2 level unit that has been rented for $12,400.00 per month including the backyard and garage. The top unit with roof top deck has been rented for $10k a month. 172 18th Top Unit is 1740 sq ft and 174 18th two level unit is 2542. Total sq ft including common areas and roof top 4,537 sq ft. Text Eduardo Campos at 415.606.5043 for a private showing. Many photos like the pool are virtually staged. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d9ki30vKO80   https://youtu.be/RlwtAz9RFp8?feature=shared        https://app.disclosures.io/link/172174-18th-Ave-bkxoud5z  Thank you."
